      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This feature was partially added, but the main point of this feature was left out. You can't see the other worlds that a person has made if you click their username. You only see their worlds if you are a friends with that user. \n\nI'm sorry my description of the feature made it seem like you can already see any user's worlds from their profile. I thought that was the case since I can see my friend's worlds, but it wasn't",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
